OL,3,GNEWSAArts festival asks: 'What do you
OL,4,Alove about Hull?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn arts festival celebrating life in
OL,7,FHull is to return next spring.
OL,9,FOrganiser Back to Ours said it would be
OL,10,Fasking the community to tell them what
OL,11,Fthey love about the city during a tour
OL,12,Fof neighbourhoods later this month.
OL,14,FMore than 1,000 people took part in the
OL,15,Ffirst Our City event, which was held in
OL,16,FQueen Victoria Square in March.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
