OL,3,GNEWSAArts festival asks: 'What do you
OL,4,Alove about Hull?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLouise Yates, artistic director and CEO
OL,7,Fof Back to Ours, said: "We'll be asking
OL,8,Fpeople some fun questions. Why is your
OL,9,Farea the best? What's your favourite
OL,10,Fplace? And if your HU (area) were a
OL,11,Fsong or a dance, what would it be?"
